      en: ["It is the largest plateau in Pakistan.", "Balochistan province constitutes nearly 44% of Pakistan's land area.", "The Sui gas field was discovered in 1952 and is a major energy source.", "The Reko Diq project holds one of the world's largest copper and gold deposits.", "Quetta, the provincial capital, is located on the plateau.", "The plateau is known for its apple and peach orchards.", "Hanna Lake is an artificial lake and a popular picnic spot near Quetta."]
